NEXT INSTRUCTIONS FOR EXISTING CRUD PROJECT
=========================================================

1. Create a form page containing name, email, age
  
   This form will be used to add new users and send data
   to backend using POST API.


2. Create a view page where all users from database
   will be displayed in table format.

   Table columns:
   --------------------------------------------------
   | Name | Email | Age | Actions |
   --------------------------------------------------


3. Inside Actions column, add:
   - Edit button
   - Delete button

   for every user row.


4. When Delete button is clicked:
   - Open confirmation popup/modal/alert
   - Take user id
   - Send DELETE API request to backend
   - Delete user from database
   - Refresh/update table data


5. When Edit button is clicked:
   - Open same form page used for creating user
   - Existing user data should already be filled
     inside form fields (pre-populated data)

   Example:
   --------------------------------------------------
   Name  → Ajay
   Email → ajay@gmail.com
   Age   → 22
   --------------------------------------------------


6. After editing data:
   - Send PATCH API request using user id
   - Update user data in database
   - Refresh/update table with latest data


7. Required APIs:
   - POST    → Create user
   - GET     → Fetch all users
   - GET BY ID → Fetch single user for edit
   - PATCH   → Update user
   - DELETE  → Delete user


8. Frontend should properly:
   - fetch data from backend
   - populate table dynamically
   - pre-fill form during edit
   - handle delete/edit actions
   - update UI after operations


9. Existing CRUD backend using Mongoose/database
   should now be connected with frontend pages,
   forms, table rendering, edit flow, and delete flow.

10. All frontend API calls should be done using Axios.

    Axios will be used to:
    - Send POST request for creating users
    - Send GET request for fetching all users
    - Send GET BY ID request for edit/pre-populate
    - Send PATCH request for updating users
    - Send DELETE request for deleting users

    Frontend should communicate with backend APIs
    completely using Axios instead of normal form actions.